<app-shell u-s="{{['d']}}" u-i="44eba888-0" bind:__l="__l"><view class="page-heading"><text class="eyebrow">我的阅读 / READING ROOM</text><text class="page-title">让读过的故事，留在这里</text><text class="muted">本机书签、最近阅读与字号偏好。可游客阅读；登录账户的本机记录分开保存。</text></view><view class="account-overview"><view><text class="eyebrow">我的空间 / MY JOURNEY</text><text class="section-title">阅读有记录，学习有回响</text><text class="small">书签与历史保存在本机；学习进度和评论随账户保存。</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="{{a}}">账户管理 ↗</button></view><view class="account-menu"><button bindtap="{{c}}"><image class="menu-feature-icon" src="{{b}}" aria-hidden="true"/><view><text>学习挑战与称号</text><text class="small">回顾进度，继续学习</text></view><text>↗</text></button><button bindtap="{{e}}"><image class="menu-feature-icon" src="{{d}}" aria-hidden="true"/><view><text>我的评论</text><text class="small">查看审核状态与反馈</text></view><text>↗</text></button><button bindtap="{{g}}"><image class="menu-feature-icon" src="{{f}}" aria-hidden="true"/><view><text>账户与权限</text><text class="small">登录、注册与审核入口</text></view><text>↗</text></button></view><view class="reader-layout"><view><view class="section-heading compact"><view><text class="eyebrow">BOOKMARKS</text><text class="section-title">我的书签</text></view><text class="small">{{h}} 段阅读</text></view><view class="reading-list"><button wx:for="{{i}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="c" bindtap="{{row.d}}"><view><text class="tag">{{row.a}}</text><text class="row-title">{{row.b}}</text></view><text>↗</text></button><view wx:if="{{j}}" class="empty-paper"><text class="serif">把喜欢的片段，轻轻折一角</text><text class="muted">阅读人物或事件时，可添加本机书签。</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="{{k}}">去读一位人物 ↗</button></view></view><view class="section-heading compact"><view><text class="eyebrow">RECENTLY READ</text><text class="section-title">最近阅读</text></view><button wx:if="{{l}}" class="text-button" bindtap="{{m}}">清空记录</button></view><view class="reading-list"><button wx:for="{{n}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="c" bindtap="{{row.d}}"><view><text class="row-title">{{row.a}}</text><text class="small">{{row.b}}</text></view><text>↗</text></button><text wx:if="{{o}}" class="muted">还没有阅读记录，故事从第一次打开开始。</text></view></view><view class="preference-card"><text class="eyebrow">阅读偏好</text><text class="block-title">让文字更适合你</text><text class="muted">调整人物简介与事件正文的字号。</text><view class="chips"><button class="{{[p && 'active']}}" bindtap="{{q}}">标准字号</button><button class="{{[r && 'active']}}" bindtap="{{s}}">大字号</button></view><text class="{{['preference-sample', t && 'reading-large']}}">山河有迹，史料为据。</text><view class="boundary-note"><text>书签和记录不会上传服务器，清除应用数据后可能丢失。本机内容已按账户隔离，暂不支持跨设备同步。</text></view></view></view></app-shell>